    <item>
      <title>Listening</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/listening/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/listening/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m almost always listening to music. It&amp;rsquo;s a huge part of who I am. After not touching the account for 17 years or so (as you&amp;rsquo;ll see in the charts), I recently started scrobbling on &lt;a href=&#34;https://last.fm&#34; title=&#34;last.fm website link&#34;&gt;last.fm&lt;/a&gt; again, and thanks to &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/biancarosa/lastfm-last-played&#34; title=&#34;link to github page for last.fm widget&#34;&gt;Bianca Rosa&amp;rsquo;s little last.fm widget&lt;/a&gt;, you can now get an idea of what I&amp;rsquo;m listening to at this moment, or moments ago.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;now-playing&#34;&gt;Now Playing&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m either listening to the below track right now, or just listened to it.&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;lastfm-widget&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;lastfm-widget__art&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img id=&#34;lastfm-art&#34; src=&#34;&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;lastfm-widget__info&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;lastfm-label&#34; class=&#34;lastfm-widget__label&#34;&gt;Last played&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;lastfm-track&#34; class=&#34;lastfm-widget__track&#34;&gt;Loading…&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;lastfm-artist&#34; class=&#34;lastfm-widget__artist&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;script src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/js/lastfm.js&#34; defer&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
